# Pairs with TypeOK. The replay step's guard dropped: the appended leaf advances
# its read position past the allocator head, out of the read position's domain.
MODULE: TypeOkReplayPastHead
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the appended leaf's replay advances past the WAL head
PERTURBS: Replay

--- FIND
    /\ rpN + 1 < next
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no head bound.
    /\ rpN < MaxOff
--- END